# The Dinner Roll: Thanksgiving's Human kind, as the Walk-on is
# Halloween's. A plump, domed roll: glossy golden crust on top with two
# score marks, a pale soft base, eyes and a smile in the crust, stubby arms
# in white gloves, orange legs, and a pat of butter melting on top. No
# helmet: the team plays bareheaded (map m2, n1).
